# Vuetify Patterns

## Layout Components

### Container and Grid

```vue
<v-container>
  <v-row>
    <v-col cols="12" md="6">
      <!-- Content -->
    </v-col>
    <v-col cols="12" md="6">
      <!-- Content -->
    </v-col>
  </v-row>
</v-container>
```

### Spacing

```vue
<v-row>
  <v-col>
    <v-btn>Button</v-btn>
  </v-col>
  <v-spacer/> <!-- Use v-spacer for flex spacing -->
  <v-col>
    <v-btn>Button</v-btn>
  </v-col>
</v-row>
```

## Form Components

### Text Fields

```vue
<v-text-field
  v-model="email"
  prepend-icon="mdi-email"
  label="Email"
  :error-messages="errorMessage"
  :error="hasError"
  :append-inner-icon="showPassword ? 'mdi-eye' : 'mdi-eye-off'"
  :type="showPassword ? 'text' : 'password'"
  @click:append-inner="showPassword = !showPassword"
/>
```

### Buttons

```vue
<!-- Primary action -->
<v-btn color="primary" @click="submit">Submit</v-btn>

<!-- Secondary action -->
<v-btn color="secondary" @click="cancel">Cancel</v-btn>

<!-- Destructive action -->
<v-btn color="error" @click="delete">Delete</v-btn>

<!-- With loading state -->
<v-btn 
  color="primary" 
  :loading="loading"
  :disabled="loading"
  @click="handleAction"
>
  Save
</v-btn>
```

### Cards

```vue
<v-card>
  <v-card-title>Card Title</v-card-title>
  <v-card-subtitle>Subtitle</v-card-subtitle>
  <v-card-text>
    <!-- Card content -->
  </v-card-text>
  <v-card-actions>
    <v-btn color="error" @click="cancel">Cancel</v-btn>
    <v-spacer/>
    <v-btn color="primary" @click="submit">Submit</v-btn>
  </v-card-actions>
</v-card>
```

## Navigation Components

### App Bar

```vue
<v-app-bar>
  <v-app-bar-title>Title</v-app-bar-title>
  <v-spacer/>
  <v-btn icon="mdi-menu" @click="toggleDrawer"/>
</v-app-bar>
```

### Navigation Drawer

```vue
<v-navigation-drawer v-model="drawer">
  <v-list>
    <v-list-item
      v-for="item in navItems"
      :key="item.title"
      :to="item.to"
      :prepend-icon="item.icon"
    >
      <v-list-item-title>{{ item.title }}</v-list-item-title>
    </v-list-item>
  </v-list>
</v-navigation-drawer>
```

## Data Display

### Tables

```vue
<v-table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Column 1</th>
      <th>Column 2</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr v-for="item in items" :key="item.id">
      <td>{{ item.field1 }}</td>
      <td>{{ item.field2 }}</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</v-table>
```

### Dialogs

```vue
<v-dialog v-model="dialog" max-width="500">
  <v-card>
    <v-card-title>Dialog Title</v-card-title>
    <v-card-text>
      <!-- Dialog content -->
    </v-card-text>
    <v-card-actions>
      <v-spacer/>
      <v-btn @click="dialog = false">Close</v-btn>
      <v-btn color="primary" @click="confirm">Confirm</v-btn>
    </v-card-actions>
  </v-card>
</v-dialog>
```

## Icons

Always use Material Design Icons (`mdi-*`):

```vue
<!-- Prepend icon -->
<v-text-field prepend-icon="mdi-email" />

<!-- Append icon -->
<v-text-field append-icon="mdi-search" />

<!-- Button icon -->
<v-btn icon="mdi-delete" />

<!-- Standalone icon -->
<v-icon>mdi-check</v-icon>
```

## Important Notes

- **Use Vuetify components** - don't use plain HTML elements
- **Use Material Design Icons** (`mdi-*`) - icons are auto-imported
- **Follow Vuetify layout system** - use `v-container`, `v-row`, `v-col`
- **Use `v-spacer`** for flex spacing, not margins
- **Handle loading states** with `:loading` prop on buttons
- **Use color props** (`color="primary"`, `color="error"`, etc.)
- **Check existing components** for Vuetify usage patterns
